meta {
  name: 10 Schedules
  seq: 11
}

docs {
  `/api/schedules`: the preview of a rule, the checks on a new schedule, user B
  (`otherToken`) getting `404` for user A's project in bodies and queries, and Run now on an
  unknown or malformed id. A schedule needs an enabled model, and Bruno has no model provider,
  so the route tests on Postgres create schedules, run them (the scheduler and Run now), and
  check user B's `404` for their ids in paths.
}
